# Repository

Keep access to one data source behind an interface. UI and stores must not see the HTTP response shape.

Each feature owns the repository for its domain, such as products or orders.

```ts
type ProductRepository = {
  getBySlug(slug: string): Promise<Product>;
};

function createProductRepository(http: HttpClient): ProductRepository {
  return {
    getBySlug: (slug) => http.get(`/products/${slug}`).then(toProduct),
  };
}
```
